    "created_at": "2016-03-24T19:31:51Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-24T19:31:51Z",
    "body": "The requirements do predate srcset but I don't see why srcset should make a difference. Possibly when using picture for art direction use of width/height should be banned. I'm not sure why intrinsicless images are not allowed width/height and I don't see any harm in allowing them there.\n",
